Family Guy Presents: Blue Harvest is a animation, comedy,
science fiction film directed by Dominic Polcino.

3
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:18,000
With the Griffins stuck at home during a blackout, Peter tells
the story of "Star Wars Episode IV: A New Hope".

4
