10
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
"Blue Harvest" is the season premiere of the sixth season of the American animated television
series Family Guy, and the first part of the series' Laugh It Up, Fuzzball trilogy.

11
00:26:24,000 --> 00:26:30,000
It originally aired on Fox in the United States on September 23, 2007.

12
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:54,000
The episode is a retelling and parody of the 1977 blockbuster film Star Wars, recasting the show's characters as Star Wars
characters, created with permission from Lucasfilm on the condition that the characters look exactly as they do in the movies.

13
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:18,000
The plot follows Peter as he retells the story of Star Wars
while the electricity is out in their house.

14
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:42,000
The title is a reference to the working title of Return of the Jedi.

15
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
The episode was written by Alec Sulkin and directed by Dominic Polcino, and guest-stars
Chevy Chase, Beverly D'Angelo, Mick Hucknall, Rush Limbaugh, and Judd Nelson.

16
00:38:24,000 --> 00:38:30,000
The episode also includes recurring voice actors Lori Alan, Adam West, Ralph Garman, Danny Smith, John Viener, Steve
Callaghan, Kirker Butler, Mark Hentemann, Johnny Brennan, Jon Benjamin, Phil LaMarr, and Wally Wingert.

17
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:54,000
It was viewed by 10.86 million viewers on its original broadcast.

18
00:43:12,000 --> 00:43:18,000
The film explores themes of dark comedy, satire, parody, crude humor.

19
00:45:36,000 --> 00:45:42,000
The tone is lighthearted and dark and thought_provoking.
